---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Experience from '../components/Experience.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<Base title="About" description="About AbdElrahman Khalil: embedded software engineer. Background, education, publication and leadership.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lead">I am an embedded software engineer working on automotive projects for OEMs and Tier-1 suppliers through {profile.employer}.</p>
    <p>My work sits close to the hardware. On microcontrollers I write embedded C on AUTOSAR Classic: an Ethernet switch driver, UDS diagnostics, MACsec, and the unit and system tests around them, under ASPICE and ISO 26262. On application processors I bring up embedded Linux and Android Automotive as guests under Xen and QNX: kernel drivers, device trees, Yocto and Bluetooth.</p>
    <p>Alongside that I build AI tooling for embedded teams. I started a multi-agent LLM approach to unit-test generation at work, and rewrote the tool as a LangGraph pipeline that builds, runs and fixes its own tests.</p>
    <p class="muted small">Name note: my publications and GitHub account use <strong>{profile.altName}</strong>. It is the same person.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="tl-h">
    <h2 id="tl-h">Experience</h2>
    <Experience />
  </section>

  <section class="section prose" aria-labelledby="edu-h">
    <h2 id="edu-h">Education</h2>
    <p><strong>B.Sc. in Communication and Electronics Engineering</strong>, Alexandria University, 2019 – 2024.</p>
    <p>Courses: Embedded Systems, ITI, 2023 (162 hours); Visual Embedded Android (AOSP), Udemy; AI course, Tech Pathways MENA Program.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose" aria-labelledby="pub-h">
    <h2 id="pub-h">Publication</h2>
    <p>
      <a href={profile.paper.url}><strong>{profile.paper.title}</strong></a>.{' '}
      {profile.paper.authors}. {profile.paper.venue}.{' '}
      DOI <a href={profile.paper.url} class="mono">{profile.paper.doi}</a>.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/projects/driver-monitoring-tda4vm/">Read the project write-up →</a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose" aria-labelledby="lead-h">
    <h2 id="lead-h">Leadership and activities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Mentor, eJad graduation-project team</strong>, 2026: guiding students on AI-automated software development.</li>
      <li><strong>Chairman, IEEE Alexandria Student Branch</strong>, 11/2023 – 10/2024: led the branch, set long-term plans and built partnerships. Marketing volunteer from 03/2022.</li>
      <li><strong>Hardware Engineer, ROBO-TECH team</strong>, 08/2022 – 08/2024: designed and fabricated in-house PCBs, including the ROV <em>Levi</em> switching system (MATE ROV, UMVC, ARC). <a href="/projects/hardware-and-academic/">More →</a></li>
      <li><strong>Public Relations Head, Success Training Programs (STP)</strong>, 03/2021 – 10/2023: led the PR team, negotiated sponsorships, trained speakers, and coached the second-place team in the Hawk Insight competition.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="muted">I also do graphic design: <a href="https://www.behance.net/ado7a">Behance</a>.</p>
    <p>Languages: Arabic (native), English (proficient).</p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .lead { font-size: var(--text-lg); line-height: 1.5; }
  .small { font-size: var(--text-sm); }
</style>
